      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511015
    m_Localized: "DEVELOPMENT TEAM\n\nJO\xC3O DUMINGUZ\nArt Director \xB7 3D Artist
      \xB7 Game Designer\nVisual direction, 3D models and co-design of the game.\n\nLUCAS
      GON\xC7ALVES\nDeveloper \xB7 Game Designer\nProgramming, gameplay systems and
      co-design of the game.\n\n\nMUSIC\nNES Shooter Music \xB7 SketchyLogic\n8-bit
      Epic Space Shooter \xB7 HydroGene\nPulsar \xB7 celestialghost8\n4 Chiptunes
      (Adventure) \xB7 Juhani Junkala\n\nSOUND EFFECTS\n8-Bit Sound Effect Pack \xB7
      Deva (@Shades)\n8 bit Mini pack \xB7 phoenix1291\nSci-Fi Sounds \xB7 Kenney\nReversing
      Time \xB7 isaiah658\n8bit Menu \xB7 Fupi\n\nAll CC0, from OpenGameArt.org"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
