      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511070
    m_Localized: "Earth \xB7 Arid Desert"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511071
    m_Localized: Overthrow the Empire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511072
    m_Localized: October 2010. Bilu visited Earth on a peace mission, bringing words
      of wisdom that were meant to change the planet's fate forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511073
    m_Localized: 42 years later, driven by a mix of rage, disappointment and revolt,
      Bilu returns to Earth. This time peace is not an option.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511074
    m_Localized: Consumed by tyranny and totalitarianism, Earth was squeezed down
      to the last drop. After a series of climate catastrophes, the sea dried up,
      and the planet became an arid, decaying desert.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511075
    m_Localized: 'The remaining resources were looted and sent on a desperate mission
      to the long-dreamed-of colony on Mars. Which, ironically, went wrong: it seems
      they needed university professors after all...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511076
    m_Localized: And the so-called 1% drifted off into infinity, on a luxury cruise
      with a destination as certain as the Titanic's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 464511077
    m_Localized: 'Earth became a joke with no punchline: the ruins of a decaying
      empire, defended by the gears of a system with no boss that no longer knows
      how to stop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42332987580416
    m_Localized: Bilu returns to deliver the message again. And this time it is going
      down their throats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42333029523456
    m_Localized: 'Once was not enough. So, one more time:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42333029523457
    m_Localized: SEEK KNOWLEDGE!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56162413174784
    m_Localized: THANK YOU FOR PLAYING!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56162446729216
    m_Localized: Returning to main menu in {0}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
